    "text": "A stylish and unique space\nTerence Lewis' home is a beautiful blend of his love for art and dance, and his faith. The entire house is decorated in a way that makes you feel as if you have entered a traditional Catholic home with a rustic, vintage feel. The tastefully done decor is highlighted by a personal touch, brought to fruition by the choreographer's good friend, Ishita Arun, the daughter of Ila Arun.",
